flowchart LR
  B[Browser context] --> A[Browser adapter]
  S[System context] --> X[System adapter]
  A --> I[Ingest + boundary validation]
  X --> I
  I --> F[Extract raw facts]
  F --> E[Recognize + normalize entities]
  E --> ST[Derive states]
  ST --> SG[Detect signals]
  SG --> OP[Identify opportunity/problem candidates]
  OP --> DS[Identify decision subjects]
  DS --> C[Confidence + provenance]
  C --> O[(Titan Observation)]
  O --> D[Downstream decision stages]
  D -. governed separately .-> G[Governed execution]
